§ `The bracket at the end of an entry: Schedule 2 para 4(1) on each side of the year or date`

-- A year in the bracket: the entry reaches an Act passed after that year, so not one passed on 31 December of it. A date: on or after it, so not the day before.
-- An entry with no bracket reaches an Act passed at any time (para 4(1)(b)).

